	(descr "New footprint (2026-10), Sullins GBC08SGSN-M89: 1x08 2.54 mm male header lying flat on the board (-M89 SMT horizontal), GS termination (head 8.08, tail 4.57), insulator 20.32 x 2.54 x 3.56, 0.64 square posts, from Sullins catalog pp.112-113. Sullins gives no PCB layout (consult factory) and does not dimension the foot: foot ESTIMATED from the -M89 drawing scaled to the 4.57 tail (1.74 long, 2.83..4.57 from the insulator); pads 1.0x2.5 = foot + 0.3 heel + 0.5 toe. Head (pins in the air) on F.Fab and inside the courtyard")
